# Vendored forks of librqbit / librqbit-tracker-comms live in src-tauri/vendor
# and MUST be tracked - they carry our patches (see vendor/librqbit/PATCHES.md).
# A bare "vendor/" rule is a common Rust habit; don't add one.
src-tauri/vendor/**/node_modules/
src-tauri/vendor/**/target/

